<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$3 bln NCDs on Friday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$3 bln NCDs on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank will issue T$3 billion in one-month negotiable certificates of deposits this afternoon, a central bank official said on Friday.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 15:00 local time (0700 gmt), the official added.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
